'''''{{lang|de|Spiegel im Spiegel}}''''' ({{langnf|de||mirror(s) in the mirror}}) is a composition by [[Arvo Pärt]] written in 1978, just before his departure from Estonia. The piece is in the [[tintinnabular]] style, in which a melodic voice (operating over [[diatonic scales]]) and a tintinnabular voice (operating within a [[triad (music)|triad]] on the [[tonic (music)|tonic]]) accompany each other. The piece is about ten minutes long.
